msgctxt "title"
msgid "Iara Cunha Passos"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "role"
msgid "Sociologist and data engineer"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bio"
msgid ""
"Iara Passos is a data scientist, sociologist, and data engineer based in Porto Alegre, Brazil, who is dedicated to building digital infrastructure and social technologies. As a Mozilla Fellow, her "
"research focuses on developing automated Natural Language Processing (NLP) pipelines to monitor violence, intersecting data science with human rights, in collaboration with Fogo Cruzado."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bio"
msgid ""
"With an MSc in Sociology, an MBA in Data Science, and currently completing her BSc in Statistics at the Federal University of Rio Grande do Sul (UFRGS), Iara’s work bridges the gap between rigorous "
"technical methodology and deep social context. She is a strong advocate for digital sovereignty, open-source software, and privacy-respecting tools, frequently designing \"offline-first\" and audit-"
"ready architectures for low-connectivity environments."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bio"
msgid ""
"Her commitment to applied social technology is evident in her work. During the 2024 climate crisis in Rio Grande do Sul, she led the development of a humanitarian logistics platform to support "
"crisis response. She is also part of the team at LabIA, an AI startup incubated at CEI-UFRGS, building tools to assist journalists with fact-checking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bio"
msgid ""
"A firm believer in passing knowledge forward, Iara is deeply engaged in the tech community. She is the founder of R-Ladies Porto Alegre and an organizer for AI Inclusive, where she continuously "
"works to make the fields of programming and artificial intelligence more accessible to the next generation of researchers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bio"
msgid "Projects"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bio"
msgid ""
"<a id=\"a1\"><b>R package precviasBR</b></a><b>:</b> Investigates the \"invisible city.\" It provides access to road precariousness data in Brazil by crossing infrastructure variables from the 2022 "
"IBGE Census with the Overture Maps street network."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bio"
msgid ""
"<a id=\"a1\"><b>Humanitarian logistics app (R/Shiny)</b></a><b>:</b> Manages shelters and donation centers during climate emergencies. Features inventory control, stock autonomy forecasting, and "
"smart matching of dietary restrictions, designed for offline-first resilience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bio"
msgid ""
"<a id=\"a1\"><b>Spatial and analytical dashboard (R/Shiny)</b></a><b>:</b> Maps sociotechnical inequalities and urban digital exclusion in Porto Alegre. Applies advanced geoprocessing techniques "
"(sf, leaflet), a custom bilingual architecture (i18n), and statistical modeling (PCA) to synthesize the infrastructural frictions of platform capitalism."
msgstr ""

