msgctxt "quote"
msgid ""
"… the absurd dies only when we turn away from it. One of the only coherent philosophical positions is thus revolt. It is a constant confrontation between man and his own obscurity. It is an "
"insistence upon an impossible transparency. It challenges the world anew every second."
msgstr ""

